          {
            "title": "Question 6",
            "id": 112453,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual era l'obiettivo di ES6?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Per correggere i problemi e migliorare la sintassi JS</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Per creare nuovi ambiti</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Per includere nuove parole riservate</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Per correggere i problemi e migliorare la sintassi JS.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Una nuova edizione di JavaScript dovrebbe risolvere i problemi della sintassi meno recente e rendere più chiaro il codice comune. Qual era l'obiettivo di ES6?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Per correggere i problemi e migliorare la sintassi JS</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Per creare nuovi ambiti</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Per includere nuove parole riservate</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Sostituire JavaScript</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Per correggere i problemi e migliorare la sintassi JS.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 3",
            "id": 112438,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual è l'ambito della variabile <code>age</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt;= \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" age = i * \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;I am &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + age + \" /><text value=\"&quot; years old.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"I am 10 years old.\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"I am 20 years old.\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"I am 30 years old.\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Ambito di blocco</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Ambito locale</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Ambito globale</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Ambito di blocco.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>La dichiarazione di <code>age</code> usa <code>const</code> all'interno delle parentesi graffe del ciclo. Dove può essere usata questa variabile?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt;= \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" age = i * \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;I am &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + age + \" /><text value=\"&quot; years old.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"I am 10 years old.\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"I am 20 years old.\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"I am 30 years old.\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Ambito di blocco</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Ambito locale</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Ambito globale</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Ambito del modulo</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere Ambito di blocco.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 5",
            "id": 112439,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che tipo di variabile è <code>countdown</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" countdown = \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt;= \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" countdown--;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(countdown);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"5\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"0\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Globale</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Locale</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Blocco</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere Globale.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Il ciclo modifica <code>countdown</code>, ma la sua dichiarazione appare prima dell'inizio del ciclo. Quale ambito ha <code>countdown</code> qui?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" countdown = \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt;= \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" countdown--;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(countdown);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"5\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"0\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Globale</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Locale</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Blocco</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Funzione</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere Globale.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 9",
            "id": 112461,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale variabile si trova nell'ambito di un blocco?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"var\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" featureEnabled = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"toggleFeature\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"var\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" logMessage = \" /><text value=\"'Feature status: '\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (featureEnabled) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" action = \" /><text value=\"'Disabling feature...'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(logMessage + action);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    featureEnabled = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" action = \" /><text value=\"'Enabling feature...'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(logMessage + action);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    featureEnabled = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"toggleFeature();\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>action</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>featureEnabled</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>logMessage</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>action</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>All'interno di <code>toggleFeature</code>, aggiungi <code>console.log(action)</code> dopo l'intero blocco <code>if/else</code>. Cosa succede?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"var\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" featureEnabled = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"toggleFeature\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"var\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" logMessage = \" /><text value=\"'Feature status: '\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (featureEnabled) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" action = \" /><text value=\"'Disabling feature...'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(logMessage + action);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    featureEnabled = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" action = \" /><text value=\"'Enabling feature...'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(logMessage + action);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    featureEnabled = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"toggleFeature();\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Si verifica un ReferenceError perché action è limitata al blocco del suo ramo.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Visualizza Disabling feature... perché è stato eseguito quel ramo.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Visualizza Enabling feature... perché featureEnabled ora è false.</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Visualizza undefined perché uscire dal blocco cancella action.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Si verifica un ReferenceError perché action è limitata al blocco del suo ramo.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 1",
            "id": 112429,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale tipo di variabile non può essere dichiarato nuovamente né avere il proprio valore aggiornato?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>const</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>let</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>var</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>const</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Imposti una volta un valore di configurazione e devi impedire sia la riassegnazione sia la ridichiarazione. Quale parola chiave di dichiarazione devi scegliere?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>const</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>let</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>var</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>static</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>const</code>.</p></body></html>"
