          {
            "title": "Example: Parenthesis",
            "id": 103790,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Scrivi la sintassi che crea una funzione freccia senza parametro.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getStudentsCount = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getStudentsCount());\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"{\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"}\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"200\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>(</code>, seguito da <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Scrivi la sintassi che crea una funzione freccia senza parametri. Completa l'elenco dei parametri e la freccia in modo che la funzione visualizzi <code>200</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getStudentsCount = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getStudentsCount());\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option startIndex=\"28\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"{\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"}\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"-&gt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"200\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>(</code>, seguito da <code>)</code> e infine <code>=&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Arrow operator",
            "id": 103792,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Scrivi il valore utilizzato per dichiarare una funzione freccia.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getStudentsCount = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getStudentsCount());\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"28\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"-&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"200\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>=&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Completa la funzione freccia in modo che restituisca il valore memorizzato in <code>bookCount</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"bookCount\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"getBookCount\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\")\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"bookCount\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".\" /><text value=\"log\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"getBookCount\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\")\" /><text value=\")\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"59\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"-&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"getBookCount\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"200\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>=&gt;</code>, seguito da <code>bookCount</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Multiple body statements",
            "id": 103800,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Inserisci i valori mancanti nel codice seguente.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getStudentsCount = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" count = \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" count;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getStudentsCount());\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"68\" endIndex=\"69\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"200\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>{</code>, seguito da <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Questa funzione freccia memorizza un valore prima di restituirlo. Completa il corpo del blocco in modo che il codice visualizzi <code>200</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getStudentsCount = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" count = \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" count;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getStudentsCount());\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"60\" /><option startIndex=\"68\" endIndex=\"69\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=&gt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"200\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>{</code>, seguito da <code>return</code> e infine <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: One body statement",
            "id": 103793,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Crea una funzione freccia che restituisca il valore <code>200</code> quando viene chiamata.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getStudentsCount = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getStudentsCount());\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"34\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"200\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>() =&gt; 200</code>.</p></body></html>"
